{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Break is a low-poly JRPG tribute to the classics of the '90s- blending nostalgic visuals and sound, snappy turn-based combat, and a multi-character-driven story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/extras/0d0286bfe64cb4987b4222bc72c8e143.poster.avif?t=1749144791\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/extras/0d0286bfe64cb4987b4222bc72c8e143.webm?t=1749144791\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/extras/0d0286bfe64cb4987b4222bc72c8e143.mp4?t=1749144791\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Under the reign of King Augustus, the mighty Kingdom of Arcadia stood strong. But as the old king fades and his son steps forward, a mysterious terrorist group named Chimera emerges from the shadows with a plan that threatens the realm- and beyond</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as a team of Arcadian agents and allies, each with unique stories, strengths, and struggles, as they uncover Chimera\u2019s motives and fight to stop a looming catastrophe.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Classic JRPG Atmosphere:</strong> A homage to 32-bit JRPGs of the late 1990s, featuring visuals and music inspired by the era.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>10-15 Hour Campaign:</strong> A story-driven adventure without filler, delivering a well-paced plot designed to keep you engaged from start to finish.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Protagonists:</strong>\u00a0No single 'main character'. Experience the story through an ensemble cast, each with unique backgrounds, skills, weapon types, and personal arcs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bond System:</strong>\u00a0All the protagonists have interwoven relationship bonds that shift based on your dialogue choices. Favouring one ally may disappoint another, creating a careful balancing act. Stronger bonds yield extra combat perks.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visible Encounters:</strong> No random battles- spot enemies on the field and choose when to engage. Battles feature fast, turn-based combat with a clear move queue for strategic planning.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guard Break Mechanic</strong>: Enemies have points tied to specific weaknesses- focus on those to 'Guard Break' them, leaving them vulnerable for the rest of the battle.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3324590?t=1749144791","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749144791","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/3788932c44c567a4bd93aa4babf15b89536fe8e0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749144791","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3324590/3788932c44c567a4bd93aa4babf15b89536fe8e0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749144791","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3463270,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guard Break is a low-poly JRPG tribute to the classics of the '90s- blending nostalgic visuals and sound, snappy turn-based combat, and a multi-character-driven story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=